# Cid, Timeless Artificer: Cycling {W}{U} (CR 702.29a) - Turn 1 Bot1 casts Cid and Memnite (2/2: one Artificer, Cid). Turn 2 Bot2 cycles its own Cid, leaving an Artificer card in
# Bot2's graveyard that counts for no one but Bot2. Turn 3 Bot1 cycles its second Cid from the hand with Pearl's {W} and Sapphire's {U} (the pool ends empty), drawing the Island on top:
